  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xE9;ponse multisectorielle (Education, Protection, Nutrition) au profit des enfants affect&#xE9;s par la crise du Sahel au Mali, dans les r&#xE9;gions de Kidal, S&#xE9;gou et Tombouctou.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide critical child protection, education and nutrition assistance to vulnerable communities affected by conflict-related displacement. This UNICEF project provides quality emergency education services for conflict-affected out-of-school children, child-protection, family reunification and reintegration services for unaccompanied children and those associated with non-state armed groups as well as lifesaving nutrition assistance for severely malnourished children under five. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 35,530 people, including 5,254 women, 996 men, 27,280 children, and 2,314 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
